tus":""},"say:5:1423165004:1":{"text":"オマエも、なかなかやるじゃないか！","source_cn":"我的徒弟也不赖嘛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9A0FAB7130C2DCC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423165005:1":{"text":"……にしてもハガルドのやつ、さっきから黙り込んでるな。どう思ってるか、直接聞いてみるか。","source_cn":"铁须这家伙一直没说话，也没表态，我们去问问他是怎么想的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x393F2816A3606D1F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:呼金":{"text":"フーキン","source":"呼金","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:祖娅":{"text":"ゾーヤ","source":"祖娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":6,"localized_text_count":5,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/jp/ep4/quest_story/14231660.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14231660","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14231660","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1423166001:0":{"text":"どうだ？ハガルド、これで村に残る気になった？","source_cn":"怎么样，铁须，现在你有信心继续待在村子了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7937DBA3E71DC11E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423166002:1":{"text":"お前がここまでやったんなら……認めるしかない。俺の頭が固かったんだ。","source_cn":"既然你都做到这个份上了……我实在佩服。是我固执己见了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38DFF41658FF89C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423166003:1":{"text":"村が混乱してる中で、逃げ道ばっか探し